# === Heavy artifacts (added) ===
# REPS experiment run bundles
experiments/**/runs.tar.gz
experiments/**/runs/

# Heavy generated data: per-switch/per-flow raw logger dumps (port/link_util/ecn/nack/...)
# and interactive HTML buffer-trace viewers (can be tens of MB each).
